## Instructions
- Classify based on how the conversation ends.
- If the user still needs to do something after the conversation, use `partial_rezolvata`.
- If there is an explicit transfer to a human operator, use `redirectionata`.
- If the user abandons the conversation or says they will return later, use `intrerupta`.
- Choose exactly one label.

